@startuml
title Sequence Diagram: Workspace Creation & Payment Verification

actor User
participant "Angular App" as Frontend <<frontend>>
participant "API Gateway" as Gateway <<gateway>>
participant "Workspace Service" as WorkspaceSvc <<service>>
participant "Payment Service" as PaymentSvc <<service>>
database "MySQL" as DB <<database>>
queue "Kafka Broker" as Kafka <<messaging>>
participant "Notification Service" as NotifSvc <<service>>

User -> Frontend : Submit "Create Workspace"
Frontend -> Gateway : POST /api/v1/workspaces (Bearer Token)
Gateway -> WorkspaceSvc : Route Request

activate WorkspaceSvc
WorkspaceSvc -> PaymentSvc : GET /api/v1/internal/payments/status
activate PaymentSvc
PaymentSvc -> DB : Check subscription status
DB --> PaymentSvc : Status = Active
PaymentSvc --> WorkspaceSvc : 200 OK (Payment Valid)
deactivate PaymentSvc

WorkspaceSvc -> DB : Save new Workspace entity
DB --> WorkspaceSvc : Workspace Created (ID)

WorkspaceSvc -> Kafka : Publish WorkspaceCreatedEvent
WorkspaceSvc --> Gateway : 201 Created (Workspace Data)
deactivate WorkspaceSvc

Gateway --> Frontend : 201 Created
Frontend --> User : Display Dashboard

Kafka -> NotifSvc : Consume WorkspaceCreatedEvent
activate NotifSvc
NotifSvc -> DB : Save Notification Log
NotifSvc -> User : Dispatch Email/Push Alert
deactivate NotifSvc
@enduml
